#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Applies CleanYourTV's launcher patch (Live TV tile and channels row, hold-OK tile menu with Uninstall, the
channel row's hide/move) to cleanyourtv's launcher, the same edits CleanYourTV.pyw makes before each build.
Generated from CleanYourTV.pyw (nikkpap/CleanYourTV-App); edit it there.

    python3 tools/patch_launcher.py LAUNCHER_DIR [--row on|off] [--row-top] [--menu on|off] [--show-live-tv]

All or nothing: exits 1 when the launcher's code no longer matches the patch.
"""
